We are using VMS-stations running vms5.5-2, DW-motif V1.1 Server as a display server 
and Xapplications on OSF/1. It works.

Check following things:

on vms session manager: -> security settings: 	node: <osf/1 node name>
						user: *
						transport: tcpip

Do not have any additional entries there with node=osf/1 - nodename and trans=tcpip.

(2) check your Motif Server logfile (sys$manager:decw$server_0_error.log)
  if TCP/IP transport is attached. if not, make sure that the list in logical
    decw$server_transports in decw$private_server_setup.com contains tcpip
     
  if you find the connection requests from the osf (xapplications).



Matthias


