    lock address:         0xffffffffb552bef0
    lock info addr:       0xfffffc0000775ff0
    lock class name:      <NULL>
    current spl level:    0
    required spl level:   7

The fix should be available from DEC quoting SPC Kit Number 15239. I would
give them all the info. on your panic just to be sure.

