Andrew> shouldn't be using rc1 or rc2?

This should probably go into the FAQ.  My experience is that this
happens with programs which do not properly detach from the terminal;
the startup process will revoke terminal access when the console login
prompt starts, and this often results in the termination of ill-behaved
background processes.

Try this program as a wrapper to your license process:

main(int argc, char *argv[])
{
    close(0);
    close(1);
    close(2);
    setsid();
    ++argv;
    execv(argv[0], argv);
}
