The crontab commands are run under /bin/sh.

Use /bin/sh redirect syntax:

	/usr/local/wais/bin/index all >/usr/users/Eric/index.log 2>&1

That means "redirect sdout to index.log, redirect stderr to stdout".

>   30 3 * * * /bin/csh /usr/local/wais/bin/index all >& 2

This means "redirect stdout to stderr".

