Subject: Version 0.3 of autonice daemon released
Message-ID: <RAY.BELLIS.94Nov22130620@axp01.mrc-bbc.ox.ac.uk>
Organization: O.U. Dept. of Experimental Psychology
Date: 22 Nov 1994 13:06:20 GMT
