Bin Li (bli@npac.syr.edu) wrote:
> Do you happen to know the OSF1 equivalence of a SunOS command "makedbm -b"?    
> On the SUN, the "-b" option propagate a map to all servers  using  the
> interdomain name server named.  I need to use the domain name server on
> other machines along with NIS on the OSF1.  I couldn't figure out how to
> do it.  I would appreciate it very much if you could help.  
