: The above cmd line matches nothing.

I'll answer my own question.  It seems the regex pattern matching that
the man page for pax describes is not exactly what I figured.  The
way to fetch portions of the tape contents is to just supply the
path fragment you want to match:

If you what the paths rooted at:

usr/lib/abc

Then use the command line:

pax -rv </dev/rmt0h usr/lib/abc

This is similar to "tar".




