Subject: DMQ (DECmessageQ) war-stories?
Message-ID: <1994Nov7.150201.3606@vulcan.iss.bnr.com>
Lines: 29
Sender: news@vulcan.iss.bnr.com
Nntp-Posting-Host: e001477.iss.bnr.com
